{"unit_id": "tag:01UH:proof", "translation": "在引理<REF_0001>的证明中，我们看到，合切性（syntomic）是环同态（ring maps）的一种局部性质（local property）。因此，由引理<REF_0002>，再结合环同态（ring maps）的合切性（syntomic）在复合（composition）下保持这一事实，即得本引理的第一条陈述。参见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性", "context": "作为环同态的一种局部性质。"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "局部性质所适用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质", "context": "描述环同态的合切性。"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "复合下保持合切性的映射。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性", "context": "作为在复合下保持的一种环同态性质。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "环同态保持合切性的运算。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引引理所在的篇名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UI:statement", "translation": "合切（syntomic）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是合切的（syntomic）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "修饰原态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "进行基变换的对象。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "从原态射得到新态射的操作。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切的", "context": "断言基变换所得态射的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UI:proof", "translation": "在引理<REF_0001>的证明中，我们看到，合切性（syntomic）是环同态（ring maps）的一种局部性质（local property）。因此，由引理<REF_0002>，再结合环同态（ring maps）的合切性（syntomic）在基变换（base change）下保持这一事实，即得本引理。参见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性", "context": "作为环同态的一种局部性质。"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "局部性质所适用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "local property", "target_term": "局部性质", "context": "描述环同态的合切性。"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "基变换下保持合切性的映射。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切性", "context": "作为在基变换下保持的一种环同态性质。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "环同态的合切性在此操作下保持。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引引理所在的篇名。"}], "notes": []}
