{"unit_id": "tag:01UK:proof", "translation": "这是因为按照定义，合切（syntomic）环同态（ring map）是有限表示（finite presentation）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "限定所考察的环同态。"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "定义所适用的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "合切环同态按定义所具备的性质。"}], "notes": []}
