{"unit_id": "tag:01UB:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为一个域（field）。设<MATH_0002>是一个局部（local）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra），在<MATH_0004>上本质有限型（essentially of finite type）。回顾一下，称<MATH_0005>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>在<MATH_0006>上的完全交（complete intersection）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，条件是能写成<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>是一个正则（regular）局部环（local ring），在<MATH_0009>上本质有限型（essentially of finite type），且<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>中的正则序列（regular sequence）。参见《代数（Algebra）》中的定义<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "essentially of finite type", "target_term": "本质有限型"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "essentially of finite type", "target_term": "本质有限型"}, {"source_term": "regular sequence", "target_term": "正则序列"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "段首指定的标量对象。"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "限定该代数的性质。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "带有指定标量的局部代数。"}, {"source_term": "essentially of finite type", "target_term": "本质有限型", "context": "对给定局部代数的有限性要求。"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交", "context": "本段回顾的概念。"}, {"source_term": "regular", "target_term": "正则", "context": "限定表示中所用的局部环。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "表示中要求正则的环。"}, {"source_term": "essentially of finite type", "target_term": "本质有限型", "context": "对正则局部环的有限性要求。"}, {"source_term": "regular sequence", "target_term": "正则序列", "context": "表示中要求在所示环内满足的序列条件。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引定义所在的篇名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UG:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个域（field）。设<MATH_0002>是一个概形（scheme），在<MATH_0003>上局部有限型（locally of finite type）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>上的局部完全交（local complete intersection）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对每个<MATH_0006>，都存在一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0007>作为<MATH_0008>的邻域（neighbourhood），使得<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>上的整体完全交（global complete intersection）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 对每个<MATH_0011>，局部环（local ring）<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>上的完全交（complete intersection）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "global complete intersection", "target_term": "整体完全交"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "引理首先给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所考察的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "给定概形相对于指定基的假设。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "三个条件之间的逻辑关系。"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交", "context": "第一个条件所要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第二个条件所要求存在的开集。"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "该开集相对于指定对象的关系。"}, {"source_term": "global complete intersection", "target_term": "整体完全交", "context": "第二个条件在所取邻域上要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "第三个条件逐一考察的环。"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交", "context": "第三个条件对局部环要求的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UG:proof", "translation": "相应的代数（algebra）结果见《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "限定所援引结果的领域。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "两条所引引理所在的篇名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UB:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面的引理指出，任意合切（syntomic）态射（morphism）局部都是标准合切（standard syntomic）的。因此，可以用标准合切（standard syntomic）态射（morphisms）作为合切（syntomic）态射（morphism）的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>局部模型（local model）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。此外，该引理还指出，平坦（flat）态射（morphism）若为有限表示（finite presentation），则它是合切（syntomic）的，当且仅当其纤维（fibres）都是局部完全交（local complete intersection）概形（schemes）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "local model", "target_term": "局部模型"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "限定局部考察的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "首句所量化的对象。"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切", "context": "在局部成立的性质。"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切", "context": "限定可用作模型的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "可用作局部模型的一类映射。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "限定模型所针对的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "具有所述局部模型的对象。"}, {"source_term": "local model", "target_term": "局部模型", "context": "标准合切态射在此处的用途。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "最后一条断言的假设之一。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "最后一条断言所考察的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "最后一条断言的有限性假设。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "通过纤维性质刻画的态射性质。"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "用来刻画该态射是否合切的对象。"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交", "context": "对每个纤维所要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "纤维在该条件中所属的对象类型。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UE:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是一个点（point），其像（image）为<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>的一个邻域（neighbourhood），且为仿射开集（affine open）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>处是合切（syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0008>，满足<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>，使得<MATH_0011>是标准合切（standard syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>在<MATH_0013>处是有限表示（finite presentation）的，局部环（local ring）同态（map）<MATH_0014>是平坦（flat）的，且<MATH_0015>是<MATH_0016>上的完全交（complete intersection）（见《代数（Algebra）》中的定义<REF_0001>）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射两端的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "设定中的映射。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "题设取定的几何点。"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "取定的点在给定态射下的像。"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "题设中相对于指定点所取的邻域。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "限定题设所取邻域的类型。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "三条条件之间的逻辑关系。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一条条件所考察的映射。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第一条条件指明的逐点性质。"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第二条条件所要求存在的开集。"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切", "context": "第二条条件对所示映射要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三条条件考察其逐点有限性的映射。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "第三条条件在所指定点处要求的有限性。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "第三条条件中有关同态两端的环。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "同态", "context": "此处是局部环之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "对所示局部环同态要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "complete intersection", "target_term": "完全交", "context": "第三条条件对所示对象要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引定义所在的篇名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UE:proof", "translation": "由各项定义以及《代数（Algebra）》中的引理<REF_0001>即得。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引引理所在的篇名。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UF:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。如果<MATH_0002>是平坦（flat）的、局部有限表示的（locally of finite presentation），且所有纤维（fibres）<MATH_0003>都是局部完全交（local complete intersections），则<MATH_0004>是合切（syntomic）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersections", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射两端的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所考察的映射。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "引理的第一项假设。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的", "context": "引理的有限性假设。"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "引理中逐一考察的对象。"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersections", "target_term": "局部完全交", "context": "假设每个纤维具备的性质。"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "引理结论所断言的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UF:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>以及局部环（local rings）之间的同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0001>即可看出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "所示同构两端的环。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "与所引引理共同给出结论的关系。"}], "notes": []}
